(text "FSW resistor connects to SW, not GND.\nBOOT capacitor connects to SW, not GND.\nVCC is local bypass only; never tie it to +3V3." (at 270 112 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ddd40605-0049-4624-ab95-d881085b9a78"))
(text "Place VIN bypass, VCC bypass and BOOT cap at IC.\nPlace output ceramics at VOUT/GND; minimize hot loop.\nKeep FB/COMP away from SW copper and RF antenna.\nOutput capacitance assumption: >=40uF effective after DC bias.\nEN off does not isolate output: input can pass through body diode." (at 345 64 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d9e69a0d-f977-4964-943d-77c83025def7"))
