(text "FSW resistor connects to SW, not GND.\nBOOT capacitor connects to SW, not GND.\nVCC is local bypass only; never tie it to +3V3." (at 270 236.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a735520c-5fdd-4273-b39b-aa972f262d25"))
(text "Place VIN bypass, VCC bypass and BOOT cap at IC.\nPlace output ceramics at VOUT/GND; minimize hot loop.\nKeep FB/COMP away from SW copper and RF antenna.\nOutput capacitance assumption: >=40uF effective after DC bias.\nEN off does not isolate output: input can pass through body diode." (at 345 188.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6bb6872e-0dc9-4d0c-a8f9-9d6da5242938"))
(text "No charging IC or cell protection on this sheet. Use protected battery input.\nDisable motor coils below 3.2 V in firmware; battery BMS supplies hardware undervoltage cutoff.\nNo load/transient/thermal validation yet. Use 4-layer PCB with solid GND for the next layout stage." (at 15 280 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "664f78d3-49a5-45af-8ea3-79ec6f2dea6c"))
